
>> countries := リスト 新規
	~ ['Switzerland']
	~ ['Italy']
	~ ['Germany'].

>> foods := リスト 新規
	~ ['Rösti']
	~ ['Spaghetti']
	~ ['Sauerkraut'].


>> counter := 0.
foods キーで: countries, 各要素: { :key :value
	counter 加算: 1.
}.

出力 書く: (['we serve counter dishes'] counter: counter), 改行.

>> counter := 42.
['TrytosortthiswithoutsegfaultingButActualNumberDe✎dsOnOS'] 文字一覧 並べ替え: { :v
	counter 加算: 0.
}.

出力 書く: (['we sort counter dishes'] counter: counter), 改行.


>> counter := 0.
{
	{
		counter 加算: 1.
	} × (3 + 1 + 1 × 0.5).
} × 100.


出力 書く: (['we calculate counter numbers.'] counter: counter), 改行.

